## Execution Policy
1. When a skill matches, read skills/<folder>/SKILL.md and any references/ assets.
2. Use namespace prefix to identify category. Example: ui:gsap-scrolltrigger -> skills/gsap-scrolltrigger-effects/SKILL.md
3. For multi-skill tasks, consult boss-prompts/ personas.
4. ANI standards: CommonJS only, zero external deps, execFileSync over execSync.